{"id":"de2e8913ee05cab6","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-homomorphism.md","title":"Homomorphism","display":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-homomorphism","aliases":["57-df-homomorphism"],"display":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。各元数的符号载体见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为候选函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\vec a)\">\\(h(\\vec a)\\)</span> 表示逐分量施加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\)</span> 是下述三元谓词确定的映射集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;h:A\\to B\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(h(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\nh(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(h(\\vec a))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\n(\\vec a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\to h(\\vec a)\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h\\in B^A:\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,h)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;h:A\\to B\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S\\;(h(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\nh(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\vec a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(h(\\vec a))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^n\\;\n(\\vec a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\to h(\\vec a)\\in R^{\\mathfrak B}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{h\\in B^A:\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,h)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Hom}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同态不要求单射、满射或反向关系保持；原对象保留。二参数同态集合以前仅在 Remark 中出现，现有正式断言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。各元数的符号载体见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$h$ 为候选函数，$h(\\vec a)$ 表示逐分量施加 $h$；$\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 是下述三元谓词确定的映射集合。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$、$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。各元数的符号载体见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$h$ 为候选函数，$h(\\vec a)$ 表示逐分量施加 $h$；$\\mathrm{Hom}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)$ 是下述三元谓词确定的映射集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"t